{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failed Game Developer is a game of redemption. Use your instincts and tactic to get your life back on track to see unlimited wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing your dream of becoming a Game Developer, dumpster dive from the open world to create a life you had previously. Pick up work along the way as you gain experience. Recover from your embarrassing short comings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Open world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dumpster diving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Buy and sell items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find jobs, careers and other sources of income in the world around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Socialize in the town tavern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lease a house or buy land and build your own house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Buy a car to get around the world faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize your character with lots of different clothing and accessory options</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to failure and disappointment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910740/2208056282008146055d88ecf84325632a32a931.jpg"},{"name":"Part 1 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910740/cbb0aebe0da7fd62de146b28ccaa53d7d2c2d6b3.jpg"},{"name":"Part 2 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910740/a7e53e2113d332b1445bb4b17be19f3be0e414e4.jpg"},{"name":"Buy a luxury sports car","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910740/bfecade8e55db942688177694e83c6ffac467786.jpg"},{"name":"I'm a lover, not a gamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3910740/b38e88497551ec845f1b3653e92471cabf3241a2.jpg"},{"name":"I'm a game developer... send help","path":"htt